title: Player flow, hello to complete (lobby handshake, 2026-09-11)

participants: Tuneshroom, Arco, Control

# Registration. Control offers "game" on Arco's hub as an o2lite guest.
Tuneshroom -> Arco: /game/hello
Arco -> Control: /game/hello
Control -> Arco: /ie1/room pushed on hello and on state change
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/room
note: SETUP holds registration open; --setup-seconds widens the window

# Lobby invite. WAITING and un-joined: white/black flash, repeats every 5s.
Control -> Arco: /ie1/leds invite flash
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/leds
note: a double tap, or two taps within 1.5s, joins with no node needed
Tuneshroom -> Arco: /game/tap count >= 2
Arco -> Control: /game/tap
Control -> Arco: /ie1/role composed config blob
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/role

# Join ceremony. One reserved slot per join, spaced 1s apart.
Control -> Arco: /ie1/leds green flash x2
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/leds
note: a Room fixture bell climbs the A major scale on Control's own Arco voice
Control -> Arco: /ie1/play chime key=<midi>
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/play

# Admin start. One authority: web URL (QR/NFC), this verb, Console, or uplink.
Tuneshroom -> Arco: /game/start dev, key
Arco -> Control: /game/start
note: request_start accepts; SETUP -> RUNNING; Room fixtures flash green x1

# Play. Gesture in, timed frames out.
Tuneshroom -> Arco: /game/tilt
Arco -> Control: /game/tilt
Control -> Arco: /ie1/leds at = origin + cue_horizon
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/leds

# Completion. Release arrives after the closing fade, not at Bit end.
Control -> Arco: /ie1/release
Arco -> Tuneshroom: /ie1/release
